id: bright
name: Bright
kind: battlefield
lightLevel: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Hard to see. Awareness and Defense Value down 2(bT), Perception Skill Bonus down 2.
text: >
  * Bright (1). Reduce your Awareness and Defense Value by 2(bT) and reduce the Skill
  Bonus for your Perception Skill by 2.

---

# Word for word what Dark does, and deliberately so: the entry prints the same sentence at
# -1 and at +1. Too much light and too little are equally bad for seeing, which is the point
# the table is making.
#
# Written out rather than pointed at Dark. These are two Light Levels and a reader looking
# up Bright should find the rule rather than a redirection - and if the two are ever told
# apart, they are already apart.

[passive]
awareness -= 2(bT);
defenseValue -= 2(bT);
skill.perception.bonus -= 2;
